<title>JAPAN: Aim Services plans share split.</title>
<headline>Aim Services plans share split.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Aim Services Co Ltd said on Friday it planned a 1.1-for-1 share split on November 20, for shareholders as of September 30.</p>
</text>
